{"seq":1,"slug":"recyclability-grading-design-criteria","title":"可回收性分级标准与设计准则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-design-recyclability/recyclability-grading-design-criteria","wordCount":2710,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"可回收性分级标准与设计准则\">可回收性分级标准与设计准则</h1><p>欧盟《包装与包装废弃物法规》 <strong>Regulation (EU) 2025/40（PPWR）</strong> 于 2025 年 1 月 22 日刊登官方公报、2 月 11 日生效，并从 <strong>2026 年 8 月 12 日</strong> 起适用。它把&quot;可回收&quot;从一句环保口号变成了一道带阈值、带时间轴、带罚款的可核查门槛：<strong>自 2030 年 1 月 1 日起</strong>，投放欧盟市场的包装必须满足设计要求并落入附件 II 的性能分级；<strong>自 2038 年 1 月 1 日起</strong>，最低档被取消，只允许 A/B 两级。对跨境电商卖家而言，这意味着过去那种&quot;包装能装货就行&quot;的设计逻辑，将在 2030 年前被分解成可逐项打分的工程问题。</p>\n<p>本文聚焦第二节「可回收设计要求」，讲清分级判定的口径、设计准则如何映射到分数、以及行业评估协议与 PPWR 分级之间的换算关系。法规总览与 EPR 注册流程见本 hub 的 <a href=\"../packaging-regulation-framework/\"><code>../1_packaging-regulation-framework/INDEX.md</code></a> 与 <a href=\"./\"><code>./INDEX.md</code></a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分级不是单一指标-而是第-6-条的四要件判定\">核心概念：分级不是单一指标，而是第 6 条的四要件判定</h2><p>PPWR 第 6 条没有把&quot;可回收&quot;定义成一个材料属性，而是四要件同时成立才算数。第 6(5) 条明确：一件包装被认定为&quot;可回收&quot;，须同时满足</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>设计可回收</strong>（design for recycling）——符合按包装品类制定的可回收设计准则；</li>\n<li><strong>被单独收集</strong>（separate collection）——符合第 43 条的分类收集要求；</li>\n<li><strong>被分选进既定废物流</strong>（sorted into defined waste streams）；</li>\n<li><strong>实现规模化回收</strong>（recycled at scale）——&quot;规模化&quot;由授权法案结合已建成的回收产能定义。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这四要件是合取关系，缺一即整包被判不达标。它的实践含义很硬：一件设计完美的单一材质 PET 瓶，如果所在成员国到 2029 年仍没有单独收集体系或没有对应的分选产线，它照样不满足第 6 条。反过来，设计上的一个非相容组件（比如全包覆 PVC 收缩膜标签），会在第 1 个要件就直接判死，后面三个要件再完美也救不回来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[包装设计输入&lt;br/&gt;材料/组件/颜色/阻隔/标签] --&gt; B{逐组件材料相容性判定}&#10;  B --&gt;|相容| C[计入可回收质量]&#10;  B --&gt;|不相容| D[计入不可回收质量]&#10;  C --&gt; E[按重量求和得可回收比例 R]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{R &gt;= 95%}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[Grade A]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H{R &gt;= 80%}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[Grade B]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J{R &gt;= 70%}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[Grade C]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[不满足&lt;br/&gt;2030 起禁止上市]\">flowchart TD\n  A[包装设计输入&lt;br/&gt;材料/组件/颜色/阻隔/标签] --&gt; B{逐组件材料相容性判定}\n  B --&gt;|相容| C[计入可回收质量]\n  B --&gt;|不相容| D[计入不可回收质量]\n  C --&gt; E[按重量求和得可回收比例 R]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{R &gt;= 95%}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[Grade A]\n  F --&gt;|否| H{R &gt;= 80%}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[Grade B]\n  H --&gt;|否| J{R &gt;= 70%}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[Grade C]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[不满足&lt;br/&gt;2030 起禁止上市]</pre><p>设计准则本身不会由法规正文逐条写死。第 6 条要求欧盟委员会在 <strong>2028 年 1 月 1 日前</strong> 通过授权法案（delegated acts），<strong>按包装品类</strong>确立可回收设计准则。在此之前，行业协议（RecyClass、4evergreen、CEFLEX、APR）事实上充当了过渡期的判定依据——这也是下一节要展开的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"附件-ii-性能分级-按重量计的可回收占比\">附件 II 性能分级：按重量计的可回收占比</h2><p>附件 II 把包装划入 A/B/C 三级，判据是<strong>可回收组分占整包重量的百分比</strong>。计分不是简单称重，而是对每个组分先做相容性判定，再按加权求和。可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\cdot \\lambda_i}{W_{\\text{total}}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.33em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.494em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个组分的质量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_i \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是该组分在目标废物流下的相容系数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是整包总质量。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示完全相容（如 PET 瓶身），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_i = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示完全不相容（如 PVC 标签），介于两者之间的情形（如含量受控的 EVOH 阻隔层）取部分系数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>可回收重量占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>2030-01-01 起</th>\n<th>2038-01-01 起</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Grade A</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge 95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>允许上市</td>\n<td>允许上市</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Grade B</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge 80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>允许上市</td>\n<td>允许上市</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Grade C</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\ge 70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>允许上市</td>\n<td><strong>禁止上市</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未达标</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; 70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><strong>禁止上市</strong></td>\n<td><strong>禁止上市</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：Regulation (EU) 2025/40 第 6 条与附件 II（OJ L, 22.1.2025）。具体门槛以最终授权法案为准，卖家应在 2028 年授权法案出台后重新核对纸/纸板与多层复合包装的品类细则。</p>\n<p>这张表暴露了两个常见误判。第一，<strong>80% 与 70% 之间的包装在 2030 年&quot;合规&quot;、在 2038 年&quot;违法&quot;</strong>——但包装模具与产线改造周期通常 3–5 年，等到 2035 年再动手，等于把改造成本乘上合规倒计时风险。第二，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>重量占比</strong>而非&quot;件数占比&quot;或&quot;材料种类占比&quot;，因此一个重达瓶身 8% 的不可回收泵头，比三个各占 1% 的小贴片更致命——减重的杠杆点往往在结构最重的那个组件上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设计准则矩阵-从品类到扣分项\">设计准则矩阵：从品类到扣分项</h2><p>把法规要求翻译成设计动作，需要按品类拆解扣分项。下表整合了 PPWR 第 6 条的取向与 RecyClass（Plastics Recyclers Europe）、4evergreen（纤维基包装）、CEFLEX（软包装）三大协议中反复出现的判据；协议细节随版本更新，卖家应锁定所用版本号。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计维度</th>\n<th>相容做法（拉高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>）</th>\n<th>高风险做法（拉低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>）</th>\n<th>主要协议依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>材料结构</td>\n<td>单一材质/单一聚合物家族</td>\n<td>PET/PE、PET/AL/PE 多层复合</td>\n<td>RecyClass、CEFLEX</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阻隔层</td>\n<td>受控含量 EVOH，SiOx/AlOx 镀层</td>\n<td>PVDC 涂层、高含量 EVOH</td>\n<td>RecyClass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颜色/颜料</td>\n<td>本色、浅色、NIR 可识别黑</td>\n<td>炭黑颜料（NIR 不可识别）</td>\n<td>RecyClass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签</td>\n<td>部分覆盖、同材质或可漂浮标签</td>\n<td>PET 瓶全包覆 PVC 收缩套标</td>\n<td>RecyClass、APR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粘合剂</td>\n<td>可洗脱（wash-off）胶</td>\n<td>永久性强力胶残留</td>\n<td>RecyClass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瓶盖/泵头</td>\n<td>同材质、可分离、系留盖</td>\n<td>异材质泵头、金属弹簧</td>\n<td>SUP 指令 2019/904</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺寸/形态</td>\n<td>分选筛网可截留的常规尺寸</td>\n<td>极小袋（sachet）、&lt; 5 cm 小件</td>\n<td>CEFLEX</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>添加剂</td>\n<td>无危害助剂</td>\n<td>氧降解（oxo-degradable）添加剂</td>\n<td>PPWR 第 5 条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>系留盖一栏不是可选项：欧盟一次性塑料指令 <strong>Directive (EU) 2019/904</strong> 已要求所有容量 3 升以下的饮料容器瓶盖自 <strong>2024 年 7 月 3 日</strong> 起必须保持与瓶身系留。它同时服务两个目标——减少散落垃圾，并让瓶盖随瓶身一起进入 PET 回收流，间接抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行业评估协议与-ppwr-分级的换算\">行业评估协议与 PPWR 分级的换算</h2><p>法规授权法案未落地前，实操中最容易被平台和 EPR 机构接受的是行业评估协议出具的等级。它们的分级刻度与 PPWR 的 A/B/C <strong>不同源</strong>，需要映射而非直接套用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RecyClass</strong>（塑料）给出 A–F 六级评分，基于&quot;Recyclability Evaluation Protocol&quot;逐项做相容性测试；A 级通常可映射到 PPWR 的 A/B 区间，D 级及以下基本落在未达标区。</li>\n<li><strong>4evergreen</strong>（纤维基）用 0–100 的 circularity score 映射到 A/B/C 三档，判据集中在纤维回收流中的可分散性与污染物容忍度。</li>\n<li><strong>CEFLEX</strong> 的 D4ACE 指南（Designing for a Circular Economy）面向软包装，重点是单一聚烯烃结构与&quot;设计检查表&quot;逐条判定。</li>\n<li><strong>APR Design Guide</strong>（美国塑料回收协会）在美国市场使用，其&quot;Meets APR Design&quot;标识在跨境场景中常与 RecyClass 并列出证。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>换算时的核心风险是<strong>测试边界不一致</strong>：RecyClass 在实验室按特定回收产线参数测，PPWR 第 6(5) 条却要求&quot;规模化回收&quot;这一产业事实。因此同一件包装可能出现&quot;RecyClass B 级、但 PPWR 判定因当地无对应产线而不达标&quot;的落差。稳妥做法是双轨：既拿协议评级，又逐成员国核对第 43 条分类收集与本地回收产能的到位情况。</p>\n<p>材料可回收性的通用测试标准则是另一条标尺：<strong>EN 13430</strong>（材料回收型可回收性要求）、<strong>EN 13432</strong>（可堆肥性），以及自愿性声明 <strong>ISO 14021</strong>。它们不直接给等级，但常被协议引为测试方法底稿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-epr-费用和再生含量的联动\">与 EPR 费用和再生含量的联动</h2><p>可回收性等级不是孤立标签，它同时是<strong>费用杠杆</strong>和<strong>设计约束</strong>。PPWR 要求生产者责任延伸（EPR）费用按可回收性等级做<strong>生态调节（ecomodulation）</strong>，自 2030 年起强制，等级越低费率越高。法国 Citeo、德国 VerpackG（ZSVR/LUCID 登记）等既有体系已在向&quot;低等级多付费&quot;迁移。这意味着同一款产品的合规成本，会随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 值从 95% 降到 70% 而阶梯式上升，设计决策直接变成财务决策。</p>\n<p>再生含量（第 7 条）则是另一条并行线，且只针对塑料包装：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包装类别</th>\n<th>2030 年最低再生含量</th>\n<th>2040 年最低再生含量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>接触敏感型 PET</td>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接触敏感型非 PET（如 HDPE/PP）</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>其他塑料包装</td>\n<td>35%</td>\n<td>65%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：Regulation (EU) 2025/40 第 7 条。两条线的耦合点在于：<strong>只有真正进入闭环回收流的包装，其材质才有机会被再生成合规原料</strong>。一件设计不可回收的包装，不但自己被分级判死，还挤占了再生料本应来自的原料池——这就是为什么分级标准与再生含量目标必须在同一张设计图上解决。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结-把包装当作可打分的工程对象\">小结：把包装当作可打分的工程对象</h2><p>把上述判据压缩成可执行的设计自检，建议在打样前逐条过：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>称重分解</strong>：列出每一个组件的质量与材质，估算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>；目标值应设定在 <strong>95% 以上</strong> 而非贴着 70% 底线。</li>\n<li><strong>单材质优先</strong>：能合并的层就合并；必须多层时，选择同一聚合物家族的相容组合。</li>\n<li><strong>颜色与分选</strong>：优先本色/浅色；必须用深色时选 NIR 可识别黑，杜绝炭黑。</li>\n<li><strong>标签与胶</strong>：优先部分覆盖与可洗脱胶；避免全包覆异材质套标。</li>\n<li><strong>系留与分离</strong>：瓶盖系留、泵头可分离、异材质件可手动拆解。</li>\n<li><strong>尺寸</strong>：避开会从分选筛网漏失的极小规格。</li>\n<li><strong>留证</strong>：保留协议评级报告、材料声明与供应商声明，作为向 EPR 机构与平台举证的材料。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最常见的三类失败模式值得单独点名：<strong>多层复合软包装</strong>（PET/AL/PE 结构几乎无法在现有回收流中分离）、<strong>炭黑颜料</strong>（NIR 分选看不见，整件被打入残渣）、<strong>PET 瓶全包覆收缩套标</strong>（套标材质与瓶身不同且阻碍密度分选）。这三类都是设计源头问题，一旦量产，改模与换料的代价远高于一次设计评审。</p>\n<p>法规授权法案将在 2028 年前把品类准则逐条落实，届时本文的判据矩阵需要按官方文本复核。但设计方向已足够清晰：把包装当作可被逐组件打分、可被分选设备识别、可被回收产线接纳的工程对象，而不是一件只负责装货的外壳。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可回收性分级标准与设计准则","id":"可回收性分级标准与设计准则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分级不是单一指标，而是第 6 条的四要件判定","id":"核心概念-分级不是单一指标-而是第-6-条的四要件判定"},{"level":2,"text":"附件 II 性能分级：按重量计的可回收占比","id":"附件-ii-性能分级-按重量计的可回收占比"},{"level":2,"text":"设计准则矩阵：从品类到扣分项","id":"设计准则矩阵-从品类到扣分项"},{"level":2,"text":"行业评估协议与 PPWR 分级的换算","id":"行业评估协议与-ppwr-分级的换算"},{"level":2,"text":"与 EPR 费用和再生含量的联动","id":"与-epr-费用和再生含量的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结：把包装当作可打分的工程对象","id":"小结-把包装当作可打分的工程对象"}],"prev":{"title":"多法域法规叠加与冲突优先级处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-regulation-framework/multi-jurisdiction-overlap-conflict"},"next":{"title":"面向回收的设计（DfR）材料与结构规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-design-recyclability/design-for-recycling-material-spec"}}